### Soft badges

A block that takes an argument receives the crumb's attributes (Appica's `render` prop) - here onto a soft
[Badge](<%= page_path(:badge) %>), which keeps idle crumbs muted and fills the current one. The same works for a
`link_to`: `BreadcrumbLink { |crumb| a(**crumb, href: …) { … } }`.

<%= embed UI::BreadcrumbPreview, :badges %>

