## API reference

| Part | Props | Description |
|------|-------|-------------|
| `Breadcrumb` | `aria_label:` | The `<nav>` landmark. |
| `BreadcrumbList` | - | The `<ol>` of crumbs and separators. |
| `BreadcrumbItem` | - | One `<li>`. |
| `BreadcrumbLink` | `href:`, `active:`, `disabled:`; block `{ \|crumb\| … }` | A crumb; `active` is the current page, `disabled` is dimmed and out of the tab order. |
| `BreadcrumbSeparator` | content | The divider (a chevron by default). |
| `BreadcrumbEllipsis` | content | "…" with a screen-reader-only "More". |

Every part forwards other attributes to its element; `class:` is merged.

## Accessibility

- A `<nav>` landmark with a name; the current page is `aria-current="page"` and not a link.
- Separators and the dots are hidden from assistive tech (`aria-hidden` / `role="presentation"`).
- Disabled crumbs set `aria-disabled` and leave the tab order.
